527342", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/613072098_3089965387860675_9196440148487262605_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zx3bFpZMGe0Q7kNvwGQbgci&_nc_oc=AdrniYFzAcWVaTppwwa-PDkk7Po7CHERM_eIuJD6kHQ3rfZ7lgtDGUiiEYwTxyBE2n0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRDRaLPkz1ZTnjHKprcJ5j5_PS3Bm5j6-aQF68eYq3_lQ&oe=6B0C7D52"}, "display_name": "OVERAY DESK", "keywords": ["Productivity", "MultiMonitor", "Monitor", "VirtualDesktop", "RemoteDesktop"], "long_description": "# One Mac or PC. Up to 5 Virtual Monitors in XR.\n\nConnect your Mac or PC and build a personal XR setup with multiple screens without adding more physical monitors.\n\n\u2705 Supports macOS and Windows\n\n\ud83d\udcbb Up to 5 virtual monitors\n\n\ud83d\udcb3 Pay once. No subscription.\n\n\u2014\n\n# \ud83d\udcbb Build Your Multi-Screen Setup\n\nArrange up to five screens around you and return to the same layout in your next session.\n\n{2309814203168725}\n\n\u2014\n\n# \u2728 More Than Just Screens\n\nKeep useful tools nearby without leaving your XR space.\n\n\u2022 Web Browser\n\n\u2022 Notes and Pomodoro Timer\n\n\u2022 XR Pen for drawing in your space\n\n{1032264606230871}\n\n\u2014\n\n# \ud83d\ude80 Get Started in Minutes\n\n1. Download the Host app for macOS or Windows at desk.overay.com\n\n2. Pair your headset and computer\n\n3. Start with a ready-to-use layout or build your own\n\nFor a standard wireless connection, keep your computer and headset on the same network.\n\n\u2014\n\n# \ud83d\udcac Need Help?\n\nRunning into an issue? Join our Discord and our team will help you get connected.\n\n\u2192 https://discord.com/invite/hgKnEHfwkr", "short_description": "One Mac or PC. Up to five screens around you. Build and save your personal XR setup with OVERAY DESK."}]}, "developer_name": "Overay Inc.", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://desk.overay.com/en/docs/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "htt